# The build context is the repository root (serving vendors ../ingestion), and this file
# applies to this Dockerfile only. Just the two projects' build inputs enter the context,
# never a host virtualenv, bytecode cache or stale egg-info.
*
!services/ingestion/pyproject.toml
!services/ingestion/README.md
!services/ingestion/src
!services/serving/pyproject.toml
!services/serving/uv.lock
!services/serving/README.md
!services/serving/src
**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
